OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain rather cloudy with occasional
OL,7,Fshowers this evening and tonight,
OL,8,Fthough a few clear intervals are also
OL,9,Fexpected. There will be a fresh
OL,10,Fnortherly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FStaying mostly cloudy with
OL,13,Ffurther showers, but a few bright or
OL,14,Fsunny intervals also expected. Fresh
OL,15,Fnortherly winds, feeling cool.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,18,Fcool and cloudy but dry. Saturday will
OL,19,Fsee a few sunny intervals along with
OL,20,Fsome light showers. Sunday cloudy with
OL,21,Fpatchy light rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
